## The Prong Decision

This is the one structural choice inside the radiant solitaire category. Most buyers don't know it exists until they're looking at the ring in person.

**4-prong corner-set** is the standard for radiant cuts. One prong sits at each of the four corners of the rectangular stone. From above, you see maximum stone — the prong tips are at the corners, not breaking up the long sides. The modern, minimalist look that most buyers picture when they say "solitaire" is a 4-prong corner-set.

**6-prong** adds two prongs on the long sides of the stone — one prong on each length edge, between the corners. The stone gets more metal coverage. The corners are held the same way as 4-prong, but the long sides now have additional contact points. This creates a more traditional look and adds a security layer for buyers who prefer more prong coverage.

**10-prong basket** is the specialty option. Settings like the Ten Prong Solitaire wrap more prongs around the girdle zone. The stone is held tightly on more sides. This is for buyers who prioritize security above all else — it's also the most distinctive look of the three.

The honest rule: **4-prong for maximum beauty, 6-prong for maximum security.** Radiant cut corners are cut — not sharp like a princess — but they still benefit from corner-specific metal coverage. A corner-set 4-prong places metal directly at each vulnerable corner; 6-prong adds two more contact points if you want extra peace of mind.

**One more thing most buyers miss:** the basket below the prongs. The basket is the metal framework that holds the stone above the band. A low basket keeps the ring close to the finger — comfortable, snag-resistant, good for active lifestyles.

A raised basket lifts the stone higher, letting more light in from the side. The stone appears to float above the band. Neither is wrong — it's a feel and lifestyle decision more than an aesthetic one.

The setting table below includes both styles across multiple price points. Choose by look first, then decide on 4 vs 6 prong within your chosen style.

